@startuml
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title San Camilo en Línea - Vista de Despliegue (PlantUML)

node "Dispositivos de Usuario" {
  [Celular (PWA)\nComerciante/Repartidor] as Movil
  [Navegador\nCliente/Admin] as Web
}

node "Servidor en la Nube (VPS)" {
  node "Proxy Inverso" {
    [Nginx (HTTPS)] as Nginx
  }
  
  node "Monolito Modular (Docker)" {
    [Django API] as API
    [Celery Workers] as Celery
    database "Redis (Caché/Cola)" as Redis
  }
  
  database "Base de Datos" {
    [PostgreSQL] as PG
  }
}

cloud "Servicios Externos" {
  [Pasarela Yape] as Yape
  [WhatsApp API] as WA
}

Movil --> Nginx : HTTPS
Web --> Nginx : HTTPS
Nginx --> API : Peticiones web
API --> PG : Lectura/Escritura
API ..> Redis : Encola notificaciones
Redis ..> Celery : Consume tareas
Celery ..> WA : Envía mensaje (asíncrono)
API ..> Yape : Confirma pago

note bottom of Nginx
  Nota (E6): Diagrama de despliegue generado en PlantUML
  como ruta alternativa debido a incompatibilidad de entorno local con Graphviz/Python.
end note
@enduml